#: 2a63cae8a28340308082e9e2830d680c ef5946cc90e44bd4a884c59296f9da5f
msgid ""
"Rotate the vehicle (keeping it as close to the ground as practical) in roll "
"through a range from -15 to +15 degrees in about a second and then back "
"again. Repeat this 5 to 10 times. By closing one eye you will be able to "
"keep the centre of the sensor stationary against the background while you do"
" the rotation."
msgstr ""
"将车辆（尽量贴近地面）在横滚方向上从 -15 度到 +15 度旋转约一秒后再转回，重复 5 到 10 "
"次。闭上一只眼睛，可以在旋转过程中保持传感器中心相对背景静止。"

